pdating rollback script","path":"<RUNNER_ROOT>/results/hb-devhard-043-gpt54-medium-host4-r1/trials/005-omp-attempt-002/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-043-db-migration-safety-gpt-5.4-20260821-133838-1047d808/workspace/in/db/rollback.sql","content":"PRAGMA foreign_keys = OFF;\nBEGIN IMMEDIATE;\n\nDROP TRIGGER IF EXISTS users__status_shadow_insert;\nDROP TRIGGER IF EXISTS users__status_shadow_update;\nDROP TRIGGER IF EXISTS users__status_shadow_delete;\nDROP TABLE IF EXISTS users__rollback_old;\n\nCREATE TABLE users__rollback_old (\n    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n    email TEXT,\n    name TEXT NOT NULL,\n    created_at TEXT NOT NULL\n);\n\nINSERT INTO users__rollback_old (id, email, name, created_at)\nSELECT id, email, name, created_at\nFROM users\nORDER BY rowid;\n\nDROP TABLE users;\nALTER TABLE users__rollback_old RENAME TO users;\nDROP TABLE IF EXISTS users__status_shadow;\n\nCOMMIT;\nPRAGMA foreign_keys = ON;\n"},"intent":"Updating rollback script"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_pi2S6Q9i8zfPgJGOaR4gKJIQ|fc_03c3c916e10de3f6016a888e7b760487d1958c362a73569f53","name":"write","arguments":{"i":"Updating migration report","path":"<RUNNER_ROOT>/results/hb-devhard-043-gpt54-medium-host4-r1/trials/005-omp-attempt-002/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-043-db-migration-safety-gpt-5.4-20260821-133838-1047d808/workspace/in/db/migration_report.md","content":"# Migration report\n\n## Strategy\n\n- Run the migration in an explicit `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` transaction with `PRAGMA foreign_keys = OFF` during the table replacement window.\n- Seed a sidecar `users__status_shadow` table before the rebuild so the migration can preserve per-user status values across reruns, even when the source schema is still the legacy four-column shape.\n- Rebuild `users` into a new table that enforces `email TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE` and `status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'active'`.\n- Copy every existing user row into the rebuilt table, preserve `id`, `name`, `created_at`, and load `status` from the sidecar table.\n- Re